    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to bring to the market this attractive three-bedroom end-of-terrace townhouse, ideally located at 10 Castle Row, F26 H1F7.\n\nSet in a highly convenient town centre location, the property is within easy reach of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and a wide range of local amenities, making it an excellent choice for both owner-occupiers and investors.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and well laid out. On the ground floor, there is a comfortable living room along with a generous kitchen and dining area, providing an ideal space for everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers three spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a separate main family bathroom.\n\nThe house also benefits from oil-fired central heating and is ready for immediate occupancy, allowing a new owner or tenant to move in without delay.\n\nWith its central location, well-proportioned accommodation and strong rental potential, 10 Castle Road represents an excellent investment opportunity while also being ideally suited to those looking for a comfortable home close to all town amenities.\n\nCall today to arrange your viewing!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.87m x 6.10m\nLaminate Flooring\n\nLiving Room - 3.88m x 4.17m\nOpen Fire, Laminate Flooring\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.86m x 4.23m\nBuilt in Kitchen, Laminate Flooring, Double Doors leading out to paved patio area\n\nWC - 0.80m x 1.82m\n\n\nHotpress - 1.18m x 0.96m\nShelved\n\nLanding - 1.89m x 3.04m\n\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.67m x 1.88m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.88m x 3.35m\nCarpet to Floor, Built in Wardrobe\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.23m x 1.80m\nToilet and Sink\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.73m x 4.17m\nCarpet to Floor, Built in Wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.04m x 2.05m\nCarpet to Floor, Built in Wardrobe\n\n"
      },
